1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:04,493
Why does every GTA, even GTA 6,
have you running from the cops?

2
00:00:04,494 --> 00:00:08,625
Because back in 1995,
a game about chasing criminals broke.

3
00:00:08,626 --> 00:00:10,132
And that bug saved it.

4
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:10,799
Here's how.

5
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,339
It's 1995 in Dundee, Scotland.

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:16,866
DMA Design, the studio behind
Lemmings, starts a new game.

7
00:00:16,867 --> 00:00:20,223
It's called Race'n'Chase,
and it's planned to take eighteen months.

8
00:00:20,224 --> 00:00:22,980
In it, you play a police
officer chasing criminals.

9
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:24,886
But there's a problem: it's dull.

10
00:00:24,887 --> 00:00:28,178
One developer later calls
it “awful… too sim-y.”

11
00:00:28,179 --> 00:00:31,166
So the people above the team
keep trying to shut it down.

12
00:00:31,184 --> 00:00:33,147
Then, something breaks.

13
00:00:33,165 --> 00:00:34,894
The police cars stop following you and

14
00:00:34,895 --> 00:00:37,123
start trying to drive
straight through you.

15
00:00:37,124 --> 00:00:37,888
They ram.

16
00:00:37,889 --> 00:00:38,729
They chase.

17
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:39,884
They don't let go.

18
00:00:39,885 --> 00:00:41,678
And suddenly, it's fun.

19
00:00:41,679 --> 00:00:43,645
So the team flips the whole game.

20
00:00:43,646 --> 00:00:44,904
You're not the cop anymore.

21
00:00:44,905 --> 00:00:46,744
Now you're the one being chased.

22
00:00:46,745 --> 00:00:49,364
Of course, the eighteen
months turn into thirty.

23
00:00:49,365 --> 00:00:54,902
Until finally, in November 1997, it
ships with a new name: Grand Theft Auto.

24
00:00:56,188 --> 00:00:59,192
And every GTA since is
built around that chase.

25
00:00:59,193 --> 00:01:00,361
The wanted stars.

26
00:01:00,362 --> 00:01:01,263
The sirens.

27
00:01:01,264 --> 00:01:02,070
The running.

28
00:01:02,071 --> 00:01:02,902
Don't believe me?

29
00:01:02,903 --> 00:01:05,188
Open GTA Online and buy an arcade.

30
00:01:05,189 --> 00:01:07,654
One of the machines is
called Race and Chase.

31
00:01:07,655 --> 00:01:09,316
So that's why you're always running.

32
00:01:09,317 --> 00:01:11,424
The whole series started with a bug.

33
00:01:11,425 --> 00:01:12,603
And GTA 6?

34
00:01:12,604 --> 00:01:14,622
It opens with Lucia already caught.

35
00:01:14,623 --> 00:01:16,495
So who's chasing who now?
